1
00:00:56,240 --> 00:00:58,799
Hello, Chairman Shen of Yunding Group.

2
00:00:58,799 --> 00:01:01,520
I'm Ma Dawei from Jinhua Garment Factory.

3
00:01:01,799 --> 00:01:04,840
I heard you appreciate driven young people.

4
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,159
The reason I'm calling today

5
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:09,519
is to recommend myself to you.

6
00:01:09,959 --> 00:01:11,599
I'm 22 years old,

7
00:01:11,599 --> 00:01:13,040
183 centimeters tall,

8
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:14,239
with an eight-pack,

9
00:01:14,239 --> 00:01:16,239
and in peak physical condition.

10
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:19,239
I can carry 100 jin of fabric up five floors

11
00:01:19,239 --> 00:01:20,879
without even getting winded.

12
00:01:21,239 --> 00:01:24,120
As long as you give our factory a mall booth,

13
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:28,359
I'm willing to lower my bottom line.

14
00:01:29,359 --> 00:01:32,120
I'll buy a tight black tank top right now

15
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:34,680
and report downstairs to you anytime.

16
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,400
If you think a black tank top is too plain,

17
00:01:37,599 --> 00:01:40,560
our factory has leopard-print fabric in stock.

18
00:01:41,239 --> 00:01:43,159
I can work the sewing machine all night

19
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:44,640
to make one for myself.

20
00:01:46,159 --> 00:01:47,879
Chairman Shen, please show some love

21
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:50,840
and give me a chance.

22
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:55,359
He actually wants to work the sewing machine all night

23
00:01:55,359 --> 00:01:57,439
to make himself a leopard-print top!

24
00:02:13,319 --> 00:02:14,639
I feel dirty.

25
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,599
Just take it.

26
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:25,639
Mr. Zhao heard you sabotaged Ma Dawei's

27
00:02:25,639 --> 00:02:27,599
deal to enter Yunding Department Store.

28
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:28,960
Nicely done.

29
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,639
I just didn't expect

30
00:02:32,639 --> 00:02:34,240
that against your own best friend,

31
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,360
you'd be so ruthless.

32
00:02:44,599 --> 00:02:45,400
Bye.

33
00:02:51,319 --> 00:02:52,039
Nannan...

34
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:53,520
I'm sorry.

35
00:02:54,319 --> 00:02:57,120
Every man for himself.

36
00:02:59,159 --> 00:03:00,120
Zhou Qian!

37
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,560
Nannan, let me explain.

38
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:12,560
I was forced into this too!

39
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,599
You hit me?

40
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:19,400
Nannan...

41
00:03:19,759 --> 00:03:20,479
Zhou Qian.

42
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,599
For your sake,

43
00:03:23,199 --> 00:03:24,439
I stood before the whole factory

44
00:03:24,439 --> 00:03:26,080
and called Ma Dawei a scumbag!

45
00:03:26,360 --> 00:03:27,199
For your sake,

46
00:03:27,319 --> 00:03:28,319
I acted like an idiot and nearly

47
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:30,159
ruined my family's own business!

48
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:33,360
How could you suck up to an old man

49
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,000
and even lie to

50
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,120
your childhood friend?!

51
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,520
So what?

52
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:41,960
Ma Dawei chose to cross Mr. Zhao,

53
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,520
and he chose to cross me!

54
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,560
If you want to blame someone,

55
00:03:45,199 --> 00:03:46,000
blame yourselves for insisting

56
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,479
on doing business with Ma Dawei!

57
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,599
Besides, I just want a good life.

58
00:03:50,599 --> 00:03:51,759
What's wrong with that?

59
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:52,879
Someone like you,

60
00:03:52,879 --> 00:03:54,560
protected by a factory-director dad,

61
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:56,280
how could you ever understand?

62
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,599
Fine.

63
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,159
I get it.

64
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,439
I get it, my ass!

65
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,680
Screw you!

66
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:14,000
Zhou Qian, you ungrateful bitch!

67
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,159
Today, I'll teach you

68
00:04:15,159 --> 00:04:16,920
a real lesson about the harsh world!

69
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,399
My bag!

70
00:04:21,639 --> 00:04:22,360
Bag, bag, bag!

71
00:04:22,639 --> 00:04:24,240
Bags are all you think about, you airhead!

72
00:04:24,399 --> 00:04:26,360
You brain-dead moron!

73
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,920
Help me!

74
00:04:32,319 --> 00:04:33,040
This problem...

75
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,759
they'll have to settle it themselves.

76
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:35,560
Let me go!

77
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,120
Let go of me!

78
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,879
Dong Nan, let go!

79
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,480
You...

80
00:04:55,639 --> 00:04:56,759
That's for plotting against me!

81
00:04:56,879 --> 00:04:59,040
That's for selling out my dad's life's work!

82
00:05:03,319 --> 00:05:03,600
Enough!

83
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,120
I'll kill you!

84
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:07,839
Let go!

85
00:05:14,639 --> 00:05:15,279
Let me go!

86
00:05:15,399 --> 00:05:16,240
Let go of me!

87
00:05:20,959 --> 00:05:21,519
Zhou Qian!

88
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,959
For what you did today...

89
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,360
I, Dong Nan, will remember this!

90
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,519
Sooner or later,

91
00:05:25,519 --> 00:05:26,879
I'll make you pay it all back,

92
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,160
every bit with interest!

93
00:05:31,160 --> 00:05:32,120
We're done!

94
00:05:58,279 --> 00:05:59,120
Dong Nan,

95
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:00,839
you seemed down earlier.

96
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,279
Don't even get me started.

97
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,240
A bowl of noodles will cheer me right up.

98
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,319
Dong Nan,

99
00:06:05,319 --> 00:06:06,680
you've got such a great personality.

100
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,439
Spicy Mama,

101
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,439
my eyelid keeps twitching tonight.

102
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,360
The city inspectors will definitely raid tonight.

103
00:06:14,399 --> 00:06:15,120
Hurry up and fry it.

104
00:06:15,959 --> 00:06:17,399
Then pack up and get out.

105
00:06:18,279 --> 00:06:18,680
Oh, right.

106
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:20,040
Fry me two eggs too.

107
00:06:20,639 --> 00:06:21,720
Alright, alright, coming right up!

108
00:06:22,079 --> 00:06:23,600
Still out here eating fried noodles...

109
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,399
You really don't have a care in the world.

110
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,639
I just love your runny-yolk fried eggs.

111
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,360
Alright!

112
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,319
The city inspectors are here!

113
00:06:32,720 --> 00:06:33,480
Holy cow!

114
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:34,720
Spicy Mama, run!

115
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,439
I'll cover you!

116
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:36,639
Hurry, hurry!

117
00:06:37,079 --> 00:06:37,560
Come on!

118
00:06:39,839 --> 00:06:40,319
Wait...

119
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:42,120
I'll push the cart and noodles away for you!

120
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,040
There's so much stuff!

121
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:48,040
Inspector Ma has let you off!

122
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:53,399
Ma Dawei, are you out of your mind?

123
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:54,839
You're such a jerk!

124
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,759
You little rascal!

125
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,759
You scared Spicy Mama half to death!

126
00:07:01,279 --> 00:07:01,560
I...

127
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:03,920
Wasn't I just testing

128
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,120
Jinhua Garment Factory's

129
00:07:05,199 --> 00:07:07,600
quality control director's emergency response skills?

130
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,839
But honestly,

131
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:09,920
that line you just said,

132
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:10,920
"I'll cover you,"

133
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:12,360
sounded pretty badass.

134
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:16,000
That's what I call defending the dignity of good food.

135
00:07:26,959 --> 00:07:28,639
Why are you stealing my fried noodles?

136
00:07:28,639 --> 00:07:29,959
Can't you buy your own if you want some?

137
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:30,959
Buy my own?

138
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,279
After renovating our factory's new counter,

139
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:34,480
I'm flat broke right now.

140
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:35,879
As your partner,

141
00:07:35,879 --> 00:07:36,560
having a bite of your noodles...

142
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,279
What's wrong with that?

143
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:39,639
We finally cleared the hurdle with Yunding.

144
00:07:40,079 --> 00:07:41,920
Don't end up with no cash to make clothes.

145
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:44,319
When have I ever let you worry about money?

146
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:45,800
With Ma Dawei here,

147
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:48,120
Jinhua Factory will never stop making money.

148
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:53,000
Why do I suddenly feel...

149
00:07:53,079 --> 00:07:55,759
this cheeky guy...

150
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:57,920
has a weird way of making me feel safe?

151
00:07:58,959 --> 00:07:59,959
Dong Nan,

152
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:02,199
Spicy Mama's had a stall here for three years,

153
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,519
and this is the first time

154
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:05,360
I've seen you bring your boyfriend for noodles.

155
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,040
He's a sharp-looking young man,

156
00:08:07,199 --> 00:08:08,079
just...

157
00:08:08,079 --> 00:08:09,000
a bit mischievous.

158
00:08:09,439 --> 00:08:10,240
In the future,

159
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:11,959
you'll have to keep him in line.

160
00:08:11,959 --> 00:08:13,199
-Who's her boyfriend?
-Who's his girlfriend?

161
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,759
All right, all right, my bad, my bad.

162
00:08:16,199 --> 00:08:16,560
Tell you what,

163
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,560
Spicy Mama will fry up another plate for you.

164
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,240
This one...

165
00:08:19,439 --> 00:08:20,759
is on Spicy Mama!

166
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,319
Thanks!

167
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,600
Add an egg, Spicy Mama!

168
00:08:23,079 --> 00:08:23,480
Sure thing!

169
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:24,839
Shameless!

170
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:25,720
Spicy Mama,

171
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,439
add two eggs, he's paying!

172
00:08:27,759 --> 00:08:28,639
You got it!

173
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,000
You're even more shameless!

174
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:32,200
It's gone!

175
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,799
You ate it all!

176
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:34,960
Don't touch the next plate!

177
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,519
If I'm still hungry, it's on you!

178
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:38,200
So good!

179
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,200
Hey, don't eat my egg!

180
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:41,799
Hello!

181
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,840
Take a look at our new development,

182
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,559
Lishui Gardens.

183
00:08:43,679 --> 00:08:44,519
We have all kinds of layouts.

184
00:08:44,519 --> 00:08:45,039
Have a look!

185
00:08:46,440 --> 00:08:47,159
Auntie Wang!

186
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:47,720
No, wait—

187
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:48,600
Just take a look.

188
00:08:48,600 --> 00:08:49,759
Your house demolition payout was ten—

189
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:50,960
No thanks, I already have a place.

190
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:52,000
It doesn't hurt to browse.

191
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,039
An elevator apartment is so grand!

192
00:08:53,159 --> 00:08:54,080
Just have a quick look.

193
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:54,759
Take a look!

194
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:55,200
No pressure!

195
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:55,759
Too expensive, way too expensive!

196
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:57,080
Just check it out. Here, take a flyer.

197
00:08:57,559 --> 00:08:58,200
Here you go.

198
00:09:00,519 --> 00:09:01,919
Isn't that South City's...

199
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,840
Property Tycoon, Mr. Ma?

200
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:04,919
Mr. Ma!

201
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:07,279
Are you here for your demolition payout today, too?

202
00:09:08,799 --> 00:09:09,960
Oh, it's you!

203
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,519
Yes, that's me!
